# `match` does not take a map apart by `{ k }`, and a map may lack the key,
# so an arm like that is no fallback. Without a `_` arm the check passed and
# both backends died with "no matching clause" (the metamorphic search found
# it by dropping the `_` arm from spec/record_pattern_anonymous.kex).
main do
  let entries = { "value": "mv", "rest": "mr" }
  match entries do
    { value, rest } => IO.printLine("${value}/${rest}")
  end
end
